      "cooked": "<p>In addition to the default POS available in ERPNext, there are other community extensions that expand the range of functions or have a different graphical design. You have to see for yourself what you need or what you like. <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/smiley.png?v=14\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Personally I think the ERPNext POS is already very good, but it always depends on your specific requirements.</p>\n<p>Maybe you Like POSNext</p><aside class=\"onebox githubrepo\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n  <img width=\"690\" height=\"344\" src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/8c600dad8cf1449617401ed8fe9f0720/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext\" class=\"thumbnail\">\n\n  <h3><a href=\"https://github.com/BrainWise-DEV/POSNext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - BrainWise-DEV/POSNext: A modern, high-performance Point of Sale system...</a></h3>\n\n    <p><span class=\"github-repo-description\">A modern, high-performance Point of Sale system for ERPNext with offline capabilities, real-time updates, and intuitive UI.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
